---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Engineering, Industrial, Civil & IT Recruitment"
description: "Abatec is a multi-award-winning specialist recruitment agency placing elite engineering, industrial, civil and IT talent across the UK South West."
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero__inner">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">30 years of excellence</span>
        <h1>The architecture of talent, built for the UK South West.</h1>
        <p class="lede">Abatec is a multi-award-winning specialist recruitment partner, connecting elite engineering, industrial, civil and IT talent with the region's most ambitious employers.</p>
        <div class="hero__actions">
          <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/for-clients/">I'm hiring talent</a>
          <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--on-dark" href="/for-candidates/jobs/">I'm looking for a role</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero__art" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="container">
  <div class="path-cards">
    <div class="path-card path-card--navy">
      <h3>For Clients</h3>
      <p>Proven delivery for tier-one contractors and growing SMEs alike, backed by REC and Constructionline accreditation.</p>
      <a class="btn btn--primary btn--small" href="/for-clients/">Explore our services</a>
    </div>
    <div class="path-card">
      <h3>For Candidates</h3>
      <p>Mobile-first job search, honest career advice, and a team that treats your next move like it matters — because it does.</p>
      <a class="btn btn--secondary btn--small" href="/for-candidates/jobs/">Search live roles</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="stat-strip">
  <div class="container">
    <div><strong>30+</strong><span>Years in business</span></div>
    <div><strong>4,200+</strong><span>Placements made</span></div>
    <div><strong>96%</strong><span>Client retention</span></div>
    <div><strong>11</strong><span>Industry awards</span></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head section-head--center">
      <span class="eyebrow">Sector expertise</span>
      <h2>Deep specialism, not generalist guesswork.</h2>
      <p>Four sectors, one consistent standard of delivery.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid--4">
      {% for sector in sectors %}
      <div class="sector-card">
        <h3>{{ sector.name }}</h3>
        <p>{{ sector.summary }}</p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="text-center" style="margin-top:2rem;"><a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/for-clients/sectors/">View all sector expertise</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section--slate">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Proof, not promises</span>
      <h2>Trusted by the names shaping the South West's infrastructure.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid--2">
      {% for study in caseStudies %}
      <div class="card">
        <div class="case-study__tags">
          <span class="tag tag--amber">{{ study.client }}</span>
          <span class="tag">{{ study.sector }}</span>
        </div>
        <h3>{{ study.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ study.result }}</p>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--small" href="/for-clients/case-studies/#{{ study.slug }}">Read the case study</a>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-band">
      <div>
        <h2>Ready to build your team — or your next career move?</h2>
        <p>Talk to a consultant today, or register your CV to be first in line for new roles.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hero__actions" style="margin-top:0;">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact/">Request a consultation</a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--on-dark" href="/for-candidates/register/">Register your CV</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
